# Learning Patterns

This directory contains learned patterns organized by agent type.

Pattern files will be created automatically as agents execute and learning analysis runs.

---

## Expected Files

- `task-patterns.json` - Task execution patterns
- `refactor-patterns.json` - Refactoring patterns
- `test-patterns.json` - Test generation patterns
- `validation-patterns.json` - Validation approaches
- `cleanup-patterns.json` - Cleanup strategies

---

## Note

Files are created on-demand. An empty directory is normal for new projects.
